The encoder and decoder declare MODULE_LICENSE("Dual BSD/GPL"); this module uses the GPL option.
The GPL v2 text is in the repository root LICENSE. The source repository supplies no standalone BSD license text.
The original decoder is retained for host differential checks. zs_lz4kd_decode.c derives its optimized ordinary-block core with local entry and overlap-copy adaptations.
The build generates a private header with only its memory primitives adapted; original upstream files remain unchanged.
